# ==========================================================
# Docker Environment Git Ignore
# ==========================================================

# Secrets and sensitive files
.env

# Database & Tag Provider Runtime Files
**/valueStore.idb
**/db/
**/metricsdb/
**/autobackup/
**/db_backup_sqlite.idb

# Cache and temporary files
**/jar-cache/
**/request
**/response
*.tmp
*.bak
**/var

# Log files
*.log
**/logs/

# Certificates and security (Keep these private!)
**/certificates/
**/keystore/

# Runtime & Local Configuration
**/config/local/
**/config/resources/local/
**/.container-init.conf

# Backup and converted files
**/conversion-report.txt
**.digest.json
**/projects/conversion-report.txt
**/migration-log-*.md
**/.resources/

# Alarm history files
**/.alarms_*

#MQTT Managed Tag Providers
**/ignition/tag-definition/
